Including Masaaki Yuasa Devil Man, a full series for Cannon Busters, Baki The Grappler, Saint Seiya,

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:43.320
Along with The Godzilla movies that were announced earlier this year and many more

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:48.340
This goes on top of the Death Note live-action movie, Blame, and Castlevania earlier this year,

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:51.560
a series which even though has no japanese involvement in its production at all,

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:55.780
was obviously anime inspired and marketed heavily towards the anime audience

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:58.860
being the Juggernaut of media streaming online,

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:03.200
Netflix having a significant interest in anime has already led to some great opportunities for the medium

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:07.354
and while I still have major problems with their policy on licensing and simulcasting,

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:12.340
if anime were to properly become mainstream in the future, I believe Netflix will have a major part to play

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:16.960
Would I be remiss if i talked about the influence of the international industry without mentioning...

